   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## instantid-character.json\n\nFace identity (InstantID)\n\nE14b - InstantID (SDXL). Facial identity measured against the reference portrait with insightface/antelopev2: cosine 0.823 vs Flux Kontext's 0.187. CAVEAT: InstantID transfers the FACE ONLY - clothing/design must come from the prompt. It also BIASES COMPOSITION toward a close-up bust portrait even when the prompt asks for a full scene ('standing on a forest path' produced a bust), because the face embedding wants a large face. Needs a visible face in the reference (>=~112 px); a full-body 1024 image gives only ~60 px, which is why portrait_heroine exists. weight 0.8, 30 steps, cfg 5.0, 30 s.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S7** in `HOWTO.md`  ·  Why it is this way: **E14b** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   ],
   "color": "#332922",
   "bgcolor": "#593930"
  }
